OL,3,GNEWSAPhotos reveal progress of 1960s
OL,4,Acar park demolition
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew photos have documented the
OL,7,Fdemolition of a 1960s multi-storey car
OL,8,Fpark after a council said it would be
OL,9,Ftoo expensive to repair.
OL,11,FEaston Street car park in High Wycombe
OL,12,Fclosed in May, before demolition crews
OL,13,Fmoved in at the end of August.
OL,15,FBuckinghamshire Council said
OL,16,Findependent analysis found that
OL,17,Fcontinuing to operate or fully repair
OL,18,Fthe structure would cost about #3m and
OL,19,Fthe site had reached the end of its
OL,20,Foperational life.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
